OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fan's charity cycle
OL,4,Ahalted by bike theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Luton Town fan raising money for
OL,7,Fmental health charities by cycling to
OL,8,Fevery away match this season has been
OL,9,Fleft devastated after his bicycle was
OL,10,Fstolen.
OL,12,FMark Crowther was travelling through
OL,13,FNorthampton on Monday on his way to
OL,14,FHuddersfield for Tuesday evening's
OL,15,Fmatch when he stopped at a Starbucks,
OL,16,Fon Harborough Road.
OL,18,FHe said he briefly went to the toilet
OL,19,Fwhen his bike, complete with a Luton
OL,20,Forange stripe, was taken - forcing him
OL,21,Fto abandon the challenge.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
